@startuml sequence-register
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Register (UC1)

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

Customer -> FE: Open the app
Customer -> FE: Click "Create account"
Customer -> FE: Enter name, e-mail and password
Customer -> FE: Submit registration
FE -> API: POST /auth/register\n{name, email, password}
note right of API
  Invalid e-mail format or password
  shorter than 6 characters → 422
end note
API -> DB: Find user by e-mail
DB --> API: user / none

alt e-mail already registered
  API --> FE: 409 Conflict\n"Tento e-mail je již zaregistrován"
else e-mail is free
  API -> API: Hash password (bcrypt)
  API -> DB: INSERT User (role CUSTOMER)
  DB --> API: new user
  API -> API: Issue JWT access token
  API --> FE: 201 Created\n{access_token, user}
  FE -> FE: Store the token (localStorage)
end

FE --> Customer: See result\n(logged in, or error message)
@enduml
